<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Chuẩn bị Môi trường và Giả lập on AWS FCJ Capstone Report - Nguyễn Ngọc Tuấn Khanh</title><link>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.2-iotsentinel/1-chuan-bi/</link><description>Recent content in Chuẩn bị Môi trường và Giả lập on AWS FCJ Capstone Report - Nguyễn Ngọc Tuấn Khanh</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.2-iotsentinel/1-chuan-bi/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Cấu hình Môi trường Python</title><link>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.2-iotsentinel/1-chuan-bi/1.1-setup-python/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.2-iotsentinel/1-chuan-bi/1.1-setup-python/</guid><description>&lt;h4 id="thiết-lập-môi-trường-python"&gt;Thiết lập môi trường Python&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Để chạy được mã nguồn giả lập xe tải, máy tính của bạn cần được cài đặt Python và thư viện kết nối IoT của AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kiểm tra phiên bản Python trên máy tính bằng cách mở Terminal/Command Prompt và gõ lệnh:
&lt;code&gt;python --version&lt;/code&gt; (Yêu cầu phiên bản 3.9 trở lên).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/images/IoTSentinel/1-chuan-bi/python-check.png?featherlight=false&amp;amp;width=90pc" alt="Kiểm tra Python"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol start="2"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cài đặt Python (Dành cho máy chưa có):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Với Windows:&lt;/strong&gt; Truy cập trang &lt;a href="https://www.python.org/downloads/"&gt;python.org/downloads&lt;/a&gt;, tải bộ cài đặt mới nhất.
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lưu ý quan trọng:&lt;/strong&gt; Ở màn hình cài đặt đầu tiên, BẮT BUỘC phải tích chọn ô &lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;Add Python.exe to PATH&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; trước khi nhấn Install Now. Điều này giúp Terminal nhận diện được lệnh &lt;code&gt;python&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Viết Mã nguồn Giả lập IoT</title><link>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.2-iotsentinel/1-chuan-bi/1.2-code/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.2-iotsentinel/1-chuan-bi/1.2-code/</guid><description>&lt;h4 id="tạo-file-mã-nguồn-giả-lập"&gt;Tạo file mã nguồn giả lập&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chúng ta sẽ tạo một file Python đóng vai trò là cảm biến thông minh trên xe tải. [cite_start]File này có nhiệm vụ mô phỏng dữ liệu hành trình của 10 xe tải và gửi lên AWS Cloud qua giao thức MQTT. [cite: 1]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mở trình soạn thảo &lt;strong&gt;VS Code&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tạo một file mới với tên &lt;strong&gt;truck_simulator.py&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copy và dán đoạn mã dưới đây vào file:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; time
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; json
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; random
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; AWSIoTPythonSDK.MQTTLib &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; AWSIoTMQTTClient
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 🔴 CẤU HÌNH THÔNG SỐ (SẼ CẬP NHẬT Ở CHƯƠNG 2)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Endpoint này sẽ lấy từ AWS IoT Core Settings&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;IOT_ENDPOINT &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;YOUR_AWS_IOT_ENDPOINT&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Đường dẫn đến các chứng chỉ bảo mật&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;PATH_TO_ROOT_CA &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;certs/AmazonRootCA1.pem&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;PATH_TO_CERT &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;certs/your-certificate.pem.crt&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;PATH_TO_PRIVATE_KEY &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;certs/your-private.pem.key&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;CLIENT_ID &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Vaccine_Fleet_Simulator&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;TOPIC &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;telemetry/trucks&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Tạo danh sách giả lập 10 xe tải với tọa độ gốc&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRUCKS &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; [{&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;T-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;i&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;lat&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;10.7626&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; (i &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0.01&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;lon&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;106.6602&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; (i &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0.01&lt;/span&gt;)} &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; i &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; range(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;)]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# KHỞI TẠO KẾT NỐI MQTT BẢO MẬT&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;myMQTTClient &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; AWSIoTMQTTClient(CLIENT_ID)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;myMQTTClient&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;configureEndpoint(IOT_ENDPOINT, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;8883&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;myMQTTClient&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;configureCredentials(PATH_TO_ROOT_CA, PATH_TO_PRIVATE_KEY, PATH_TO_CERT)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;print(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Đang kết nối đến AWS IoT Core...&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# VÒNG LẶP GỬI DỮ LIỆU (1 GIÂY/LẦN)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# ==========================================&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;try&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; myMQTTClient&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;connect()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; print(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;✅ Kết nối thành công!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;while&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; truck &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; TRUCKS:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Sinh dữ liệu ngẫu nhiên cho nhiệt độ và vị trí&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; data &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;truck_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: truck[&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;],
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;temperature&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: round(random&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;uniform(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2.0&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;8.0&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;),
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;latitude&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: round(truck[&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;lat&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;] &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; random&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;uniform(&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0.001&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0.001&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;),
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;longitude&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: round(truck[&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;lon&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;] &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; random&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;uniform(&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0.001&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0.001&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;),
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;timestamp_ms&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: int(time&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;time() &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1000&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; payload &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; json&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;dumps(data)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; myMQTTClient&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;publish(TOPIC, payload, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; print(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;truck[&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;id&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;] Đã gửi: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;payload&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; time&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;sleep(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;) 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;except&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;KeyboardInterrupt&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; print(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;🛑 Đã dừng gửi dữ liệu.&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; myMQTTClient&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;disconnect()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol start="4"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lưu file vào thư mục dự án của bạn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lưu ý:&lt;/strong&gt; Bạn cần thay thế &lt;code&gt;YOUR_AWS_IOT_ENDPOINT&lt;/code&gt; và tên các file chứng chỉ bằng thông tin thật mà bạn sẽ khởi tạo trong phần &lt;strong&gt;Triển khai hệ thống&lt;/strong&gt; tiếp theo.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>